      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CANTARA GYPSY (1) ran a nice race two back to fill a minor placing then got off the mark last time (18.29) at this track over 305m. Nicely drawn here. Rates a top chance again. SLOVAKIA (2) is mixing form and out of the placings last time but was a Maiden winner three starts ago and moves to Box 2 this time where she has performed well. This looks easier and expected to improve sharply. SAINT ELLA (7) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing seventh (18.42) in a Grade 5 at this track. Has the ability to give this a shake. MISTY AUTUMN (8) must be respected despite an unplaced effort here most recently.",
